leyla-audio-decode - DTS and TrueHD/MLP decoders for the Leyla web client,
built from FFmpeg's dca, truehd and mlp decoders.

The glue code (glue.c) and the build scripts are part of Leyla. The compiled
module links FFmpeg's libavcodec and libavutil, built without --enable-gpl or
--enable-nonfree, and is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version, as FFmpeg is. The
licence text is in LICENSE beside this file.

